On 3.1:
https://github.com/dotnet/corefx/blob/29a6367ee4311da8ce984cfbd358d3214779fe59/src/System.Text.Json/src/System/Text/Json/Serialization/JsonPropertyInfoNotNullable.cs#L115-L122

Current master (5.0):
https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/5d8f92435ebfeab67b41aba0bce12e1e8af3187e/src/libraries/System.Text.Json/src/System/Text/Json/Serialization/Converters/Collection/ArrayConverter.cs#L58-L59

I believe this needs to special-case/handle null:
https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/5d8f92435ebfeab67b41aba0bce12e1e8af3187e/src/libraries/System.Text.Json/src/System/Text/Json/Serialization/JsonConverterOfT.cs#L63-L68

Also, we have a test gap here for null elements in collections and enumerables (both with custom converter and default converter).

cc @Jozkee, @layomia

